@startuml 07-stage-composition
' 舞台图层与节点树：谁盖在谁上面，谁负责什么
title 舞台合成 —— 图层 z 序 与 Godot 节点树

skinparam defaultFontName "Sans Serif"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "VNStage  （z 从下往上）" {

  package "z=0  BackgroundLayer" #E3F2FD {
    component "背景  TextureRect\n（外部路径加载的图片）" as BgTex
    note bottom of BgTex
      **没设背景时** = 中性底色（取自主题）。
      这是合法初始态，不是缺失态。
    end note
  }

  package "z=10  PropLayer / behind" #E1F5FE {
    component "道具（角色**身后**）\nid + 路径 + 槽位/坐标 + scale" as PropBack
  }

  package "z=20  CharacterLayer" #F1F8E9 {
    component "CharacterRig\n**整张情绪立绘**（一个 Sprite2D）" as Sprite
    component "呼吸 / 入退场 / 说话时轻微起伏\n（Tween，与图片无关）" as Motion
    note right of Sprite
      **不做分层部件。**
      图片生成器很难产出可分离且
      风格一致的部件（眉毛单独一张图，
      风格必然飘）；但「同一角色换表情」
      它靠参考图做得到。
      → 一个情绪一张整图，槽位固定：
      neutral / happy / sad / angry /
      surprised / thinking / embarrassed / tired
    end note
  }

  package "z=30  PropLayer / front" #FFF3E0 {
    component "道具（角色**身前**）" as PropFront
  }

  package "z=40  FxLayer" #FFF8E1 {
    component "转场（淡入淡出 / 交叉淡化）" as Trans
    component "镜头（轻微 shake / zoom）" as Cam
  }

  package "z=50  DialogueLayer" #FFFDE7 {
    component "NamePlate  名牌" as Name
    component "DialogueBox  台词 + 打字机 + ▼" as Box
    component "InputBar  输入栏（说话时收起）" as Input
    note bottom of Box
      **冷启动时，画面上只有这一层。**
    end note
  }

  package "z=60  OverlayLayer" #F3E5F5 {
    component "ChoicePanel  选项气泡（vn_ask）" as Choice
    component "BacklogPanel  会话记录 «默认隐藏»" as Backlog
    component "StatusHud  连接态 / 忙碌小指示" as Hud
    component "SettingsMenu" as Settings
    component "DebugOverlay  «F3, 默认关»\n原始事件 / 被丢弃的思考与工具" as Debug
  }
}

Sprite -[hidden]- Motion
PropBack -[hidden]- PropFront

note as N1
  **节点树（client/scenes/stage/vn_stage.tscn）**

  VNStage (Node2D)
  ├── BackgroundLayer (Node2D, z=0)
  │   └── Bg (TextureRect)                ← 外部图片，未设时隐藏
  ├── PropLayerBehind (Node2D, z=10)
  │   └── <动态生成的 Sprite2D，按 id 索引>
  ├── CharacterLayer (Node2D, z=20)
  │   └── Rig (CharacterRig)              ← 未注册角色时不实例化
  │       └── Sprite (Sprite2D)           ← 整张情绪立绘
  ├── PropLayerFront (Node2D, z=30)
  ├── FxLayer (CanvasLayer, layer=1)
  ├── DialogueLayer (CanvasLayer, layer=2)
  │   ├── NamePlate / DialogueBox / InputBar
  └── OverlayLayer (CanvasLayer, layer=3)
      ├── ChoicePanel / BacklogPanel / StatusHud
      ├── SettingsMenu
      └── DebugOverlay
end note

note as N2 #E8F5E9
  **除 FxLayer 与 DialogueLayer 外，
  所有层的内容都持久化**
  （user://stage/<sessionId>.json）——
  关掉重开原样恢复，
  只有 AI 再调工具才会变。（§9.6）
end note

@enduml
